# /repo auditandcleaning → repository audit

If the user message is exactly **`/repo auditandcleaning`**, **`/repo-auditandcleaning`**,
**`/repo audit and cleaning`**, or clearly means that slash command, **immediately**
follow `.cursor/skills/repo-audit-and-cleaning/SKILL.md` (read `PROMPT.md` verbatim).

This is an **analysis-only** audit. Do **not** modify the repository unless the
user explicitly asks for cleanup in a later message.

Do not ask which skill to use. Do not treat vague “gör spelet bättre / cleanup”
as this command — only run it when they invoke the slash (or clearly name it).
